{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011ktaqdQ9NNzZwEaUtEpTUk","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t//! QUIC frame types and (eventually) frame encode/decode logic.\n2\t\n3\t/// QUIC frame-type tags.\n4\t///\n5\t/// Wire values exceed `u32` for some extension frame types, hence\n6\t/// the `#[repr(u64)]`.  `StreamRangeMin`/`StreamRangeMax` mark the\n7\t/// inclusive bounds of the eight-variant STREAM frame block\n8\t/// (0x08-0x0f); the bit-flag-encoded variants in between aren't\n9\t/// individually named.\n10\t#[derive(Debug, Copy, Clone, PartialEq, Eq)]\n11\t#[repr(u64)]\n12\tpub enum FrameType {\n13\t    Padding = 0,\n14\t    Ping = 1,\n15\t    Ack = 0x02,\n16\t    AckEcn = 0x03,\n17\t    ResetStream = 0x04,\n18\t    StopSending = 0x05,\n19\t    CryptoHs = 0x06,\n20\t    NewToken = 0x07,\n21\t    StreamRangeMin = 0x08,\n22\t    StreamRangeMax = 0x0f,\n23\t    MaxData = 0x10,\n24\t    MaxStreamData = 0x11,\n25\t    MaxStreamsBidir = 0x12,\n26\t    MaxStreamsUnidir = 0x13,\n27\t    DataBlocked = 0x14,\n28\t    StreamDataBlocked = 0x15,\n29\t    StreamsBlockedBidir = 0x16,\n30\t    StreamsBlockedUnidir = 0x17,\n31\t    NewConnectionId = 0x18,\n32\t    RetireConnectionId = 0x19,\n33\t    PathChallenge = 0x1a,\n34\t    PathResponse = 0x1b,\n35\t    ConnectionClose = 0x1c,\n36\t    ApplicationClose = 0x1d,\n37\t    HandshakeDone = 0x1e,\n38\t    ImmediateAck = 0x1F,\n39\t    ResetStreamAt = 0x24,\n40\t    Datagram = 0x30,\n41\t    DatagramL = 0x31,\n42\t    PathAck = 0x3e,\n43\t    PathAckEcn = 0x3f,\n44\t    AckFrequency = 0xAF,\n45\t    TimeStamp = 757,\n46\t    PathAbandon = 0x3e75,\n47\t    PathBackup = 0x3e76,\n48\t    PathAvailable = 0x3e77,\n49\t    PathNewConnectionId = 0x3e78,\n50\t    PathRetireConnectionId = 0x3e79,\n51\t    MaxPathId = 0x3e7a,\n52\t    PathsBlocked = 0x3e7b,\n53\t    PathCidBlocked = 0x3e7c,\n54\t    Bdp = 0xebd9,\n55\t    ObservedAddressV4 = 0x9f81a6,\n56\t    ObservedAddressV6 = 0x9f81a7,\n57\t}\n58\t\n5